    "title": "Banana bread",
    "description": "A moist, deeply banana-y loaf studded with nuts, the kind that disappears by the slice.",
    "body": "<div><img style=\"max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%;\" src=\"images/recipes/banana-bread.jpg\"/><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">1 stick (1/2 cup) butter (113 g)</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">100 g brown sugar, 30 g fake brown sugar</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">2 eggs</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">1 1/2 (188 g) cup flour</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">1 tbsp</span><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"> (17 g) baking soda</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">1 tsp (5 g) baking powder</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">1/2 tsp</span><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"> (3 g) salt</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">3 banana (1/2 cup) very ripe</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">1/2 cup</span><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"> (123 g) sour cream</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">1 1/2 (4-5 g) tsp cinnamon </span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">1 tsp</span><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"> (4.2 g) vanilla</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">1 cup</span><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"> (150 g) chopped walnuts</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">1/2 cup</span><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"> (100 g) chocolate chip (optional)</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">Preheat oven 350</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">Mix 1 stick of butter (loose/warm), 130 g sugar (light and fluffy)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">Beat 2 eggs</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">Mix all</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">Separately Alak 188 g flour and mix with 1 tbsp baking soda, 1 tsp baking powder and 1/2 tsp salt</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">Combine with the wet mixture </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">Mush 3 bananas</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">Add 123 g sour cream, 1 tsp vanilla and stir well</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">Add 150 g walnut, 100 g chocolate chip, 1.5 tsp cinnamon</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">Add saffron and one orange zest optional</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">Pour in pan</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">Bake for </span><span style=\"font-size: 23px\">1 h 15</span><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"> min (35 for smaller individual breads)</span></li>\n</ol>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 23px\"><br></span></div>\n",
